BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:corl-2026-jim-fan@raymuxinliu.com
DTSTAMP:20261109T084258Z
DTSTART:20261109T194500Z
DTEND:20261109T203000Z
SUMMARY:Jim Fan (NVIDIA) · World Action Models and Agentic Robotics
LOCATION:Hilton Austin main stage · also streamed at JW Marriott
DESCRIPTION:Jim Fan announced 1:45 p.m. and NVIDIA lists 1:50 p.m. Austin t
 ime. Covers world action models\, robot foundation models\, and how video\
 , robot data and simulation support training. The 2:30 p.m. end is a plann
 ing estimate. Check Cvent for the exact slot.
CATEGORIES:Keynotes & panels
STATUS:TENTATIVE
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/events/corl/
END:VEVENT
